<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin raises possible Russia-Belarus merger.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin raises possible Russia-Belarus merger.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin has said that Russia and Belarus should consider the idea of a possible referendum in both states over unification &quot;in one form or another&quot;, the Kremlin press secretary said on Monday.</p>
<p>Sergei Yastrzhembsky told a briefing that Yeltsin had expressed this &quot;strategic idea&quot; in a letter to Belarus leader Alexander Lukashenko.</p>
</text>
